-- exactly. Owner: "put in that information but not anything like 'hose included', the hookahs are standalone".
-- Names: the four stand-ins get the makers' names. A row the shop has renamed in the item editor is left alone (each
-- UPDATE needs the old stand-in name), and the old name goes into audit_log first. Facts: height, the piece's own weight
-- (item_weight_g, shown only; never the pack weight shipping uses), material, size, features, with the source in
-- store/catalog/suppliers/ace*/master.json (src 'web:<url> 2026-11-27'). Nothing about what comes in the box.
-- The Molotov's description loses 'pictured by Ace with a hose and a bowl' (only while it is still the writer's text).
-- Safe to run twice: every statement is guarded, so a second run changes nothing.
